  "description": "At a formal marriage meeting, omega Seo-Ho drops a shocking bombshell... he’s pregnant. But there’s a twist: the father isn’t his fiancé, but a complete stranger he only met the night before. That stranger is Eun-Hyun, a wealthy alpha from a powerful family. With no time to backtrack, Seo-Ho is forced into a fake engagement with him, a contract bound by secrets, lies, and complicated emotions. As they navigate family expectations, public scrutiny, and their own tangled feelings, tension simmers between them. Can this accidental couple survive the chaos they’ve unleashed, or will their carefully built house of cards come crashing down?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
